; The C++ compilation of programs by the Arduino backend: parity of the runs
; of programs compiled for the host with the interpreter, the generated code,
; the rejection of constructs outside the fragment, and the PlatformIO projects
; of devices with their host simulation. Skipped unless a C++17
; compiler c++ is available.

